                <p>Affordable and convenient electric scooter rentals around Randburg, Cresta and UJ.</p>
                <a href="enquiry.html" class="button">Hire a Scooter</a>
            </div>

            <picture>
                <source media="(max-width: 700px)" srcset="images/hero-small.jpg">
                <img src="images/hero-large.jpg" alt="An EcoRide SA electric scooter ready to hire">
            </picture>
        </section>

        <!-- short intro about the company -->
        <section class="narrow">
            <h2>Welcome to EcoRide SA</h2>
            <p>EcoRide SA is an electric scooter rental company based in Randburg, Gauteng.</p>
            <p>The company was started in January 2025 by two engineering students from the University of Johannesburg
                who wanted an affordable way to get around for short trips.</p>
            <p>We started with 20 electric scooters in Randburg CBD, Cresta and UJ Kingsway Campus. Today we have 80
                scooters.</p>
            <a href="about_us.html">Read more about us</a>
        </section>

        <!-- three reasons to choose us -->
        <section>
            <h2>Why Choose EcoRide SA?</h2>
            <div class="card-container">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Affordable</h3>
                    <p>A cheap alternative for short trips, with clear prices and no hidden costs.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Easy Booking</h3>
                    <p>Send an enquiry or book a scooter online without having to speak to anyone.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Eco-Friendly</h3>
                    <p>Electric scooters are a greener way to travel short distances.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- who we are for -->
        <section class="narrow">
            <h2>Who Is EcoRide SA For?</h2>
            <p>Our main customers are students and young professionals between 18 and 35 years old.</p>
            <p>We focus on the Gauteng region, including UJ, Wits, Randburg, Sandton and Fourways.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- pickup points -->
        <section>
            <h2>Our Locations</h2>
            <div class="card-container">
                <div class="card">
